<title>UK: DEPfA Finance sets 1.0 billion mark bond.</title>
<headline>DEPfA Finance sets 1.0 billion mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, DG Bank and Dresner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    14.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.05     PAY DATE   S04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     LISTING    FFT	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7 BP	SELL CONC  23 BP     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANBRIEF SERIES 428</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
